    "note": "Written for live-mix on cpp/kit. Organ footages and the celeste, tremulant and bellows behave as on a harmonium or a small pipe organ in outline (ranks at 16', 8', 4', 2 2/3' and 2' locked to one phase per key, wind pressure moving level and pitch together); it is a signal model, not a physical model of reeds or pipes, and uses no samples."
